// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1071.001
// Description: Detects the installation of VsCode tunnel (code-tunnel) as a service.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine CONTAINS "tunnel " AND CommandLine CONTAINS "service" AND CommandLine CONTAINS "internal-run" AND CommandLine CONTAINS "tunnel-service.log"))
